@startuml
title Appendix — Composite preserves Stage-1 evidence; it does not fuse scores
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

rectangle "Typed ordered selection\n[BAYESIAN, FUZZY]\nunique; max 8" as selection
rectangle "RiskSignalDetectorFactory" as factory
rectangle "One Composite\nRiskSignalDetectorPort" as composite
rectangle "Bayesian leaf\nposterior-tail artifact" as bayesian
rectangle "Fuzzy leaf\ngraded-rule artifact" as fuzzy
rectangle "Ordered canonical evidence\n[Bayesian artifact, Fuzzy artifact]" as output

selection --> factory
factory --> composite
composite --> bayesian : same CustomerSnapshot
composite --> fuzzy : same CustomerSnapshot
bayesian --> output : preserve artifact
fuzzy --> output : preserve artifact

note bottom of composite
Structural concatenation only.
No averaging, calibration or ensemble score.
A child failure stops detector execution.
end note

note bottom of output
Current selectable concrete leaves:
Bayesian, fuzzy and Random Forest.
Child evidence stays distinct.
end note
@enduml
